               "text": "<p class=\"desc\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 720 400\" role=\"img\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid meet\" style=\"width:100%; height:auto; max-width:760px; display:block; margin:0 auto;\" aria-label=\"Dois eixos perpendiculares X e Y. Um vetor vermelho desde a origem chega a um ponto a quatro metros em X e três metros em Y; o mesmo vetor tem raio cinco metros e ângulo trinta e sete graus\"><text x=\"105\" y=\"36\" font-size=\"19\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#333333\">Lineares: (x, y) = (4 m, 3 m)</text><text x=\"105\" y=\"64\" font-size=\"19\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#333333\">Radiais: (r, θ) = (5 m, 37°)</text><line x1=\"50\" y1=\"340\" x2=\"684.0\" y2=\"340.0\" stroke=\"#555555\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><polygon points=\"684.0,347.0 700,340 684.0,333.0\" fill=\"#555555\"/><line x1=\"80\" y1=\"365\" x2=\"80.0\" y2=\"46.0\" stroke=\"#555555\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><polygon points=\"87.0,46.0 80,30 73.0,46.0\" fill=\"#555555\"/><line x1=\"420\" y1=\"85\" x2=\"420\" y2=\"340\" stroke=\"#999999\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"7 5\"/><line x1=\"420\" y1=\"85\" x2=\"80\" y2=\"85\" stroke=\"#999999\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"7 5\"/><line x1=\"80\" y1=\"340\" x2=\"406.0\" y2=\"340.0\" stroke=\"#2f6fb3\" stroke-width=\"6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><polygon points=\"406.0,347.0 420,340 406.0,333.0\" fill=\"#2f6fb3\"/><line x1=\"80\" y1=\"340\" x2=\"80.0\" y2=\"99.0\" stroke=\"#27ae60\" stroke-width=\"6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><polygon points=\"87.0,99.0 80,85 73.0,99.0\" fill=\"#27ae60\"/><line x1=\"80\" y1=\"340\" x2=\"408.8\" y2=\"93.4\" stroke=\"#c0392b\" stroke-width=\"6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><polygon points=\"412.4,98.2 420,85 405.2,88.6\" fill=\"#c0392b\"/><path d=\"M 150.0 340.0 A 70 70 0 0 0 136.0 298.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"158\" y=\"320\" font-size=\"22\" font-style=\"italic\" fill=\"#333333\">θ</text><circle cx=\"80\" cy=\"340\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#333333\"/><text x=\"66\" y=\"358\" font-size=\"18\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#333333\">O</text><text x=\"708\" y=\"347\" font-size=\"18\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#333333\">X</text><text x=\"70\" y=\"30\" font-size=\"18\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#333333\">Y</text><text x=\"250\" y=\"366\" font-size=\"18\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#2f6fb3\">x = 4 m</text><text x=\"95\" y=\"212\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#27ae60\">y = 3 m</text><text x=\"280\" y=\"242\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#c0392b\">r = 5 m</text><text x=\"432\" y=\"77\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#333333\">P (4, 3)</text><circle cx=\"420\" cy=\"85\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#333333\"/></svg></p><p class=\"desc\"><b>Figura 4</b>: O mesmo vetor escrito de duas maneiras. Em coordenadas lineares ele tem x = 4 m e y = 3 m; em coordenadas radiais ele tem r = 5 m e θ ≈ 37°.</p>",
