               "text": "<p class=\"desc\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 720 500\" role=\"img\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid meet\" style=\"width:100%; height:auto; max-width:760px; display:block; margin:0 auto;\" aria-label=\"Eixos tridimensionais X, Y e Z dentro de um quarto transparente de esfera. Um vetor vermelho sai do plano e chega a um ponto P sobre a superfície curva do quarto de esfera. Os valores são mostrados em coordenadas lineares x = 4, y = 3 e z = 5, coordenadas radiais r = 5 e theta = 37 graus, e coordenadas esféricas r = 7,1, theta = 37 graus e phi = 45 graus\"><text x=\"20\" y=\"428\" font-size=\"19\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#333333\">Lineares: (x, y, z) = (4 m, 3 m, 5 m)</text><text x=\"20\" y=\"452\" font-size=\"19\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#333333\">Radiais: (r, θ) = (5 m, 37°)</text><text x=\"20\" y=\"476\" font-size=\"19\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#333333\">Esféricas: (r, θ, φ) = (7,1 m, 37°, 45°)</text><polygon points=\"300,360 600,400 693.5,230.0 393.5,190.0\" fill=\"#eaf2fa\" stroke=\"#b9cde3\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><defs><radialGradient id=\"a494d959SphereGrad\" cx=\"0.32\" cy=\"0.22\" r=\"1.05\"><stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#ffffff\" stop-opacity=\"0.55\"/><stop offset=\"45%\" stop-color=\"#a9c9e8\" stop-opacity=\"0.28\"/><stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#2f6fb3\" stop-opacity=\"0.10\"/></radialGradient></defs><g id=\"sphericalOctant\"><path d=\"M 300.0,360.0 L 300.0,7.0 A 353.0 353.0 0 0 1 649.9,406.7 Z\" fill=\"url(#a494d959SphereGrad)\" stroke=\"#4f8bc4\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-opacity=\"0.9\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><path d=\"M 300.0,28.2 A 331.8 331.8 0 0 1 628.9,403.9\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-opacity=\"0.35\"/><path d=\"M 300.0,360.0 L 489.8,62.4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#4f8bc4\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-opacity=\"0.22\"/><path d=\"M 300.0,360.0 L 620.1,211.2\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#4f8bc4\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-opacity=\"0.22\"/></g><line x1=\"300\" y1=\"360\" x2=\"480.0\" y2=\"384.0\" stroke=\"#2f6fb3\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"7 5\"/><line x1=\"480.0\" y1=\"384.0\" x2=\"557.0\" y2=\"244.0\" stroke=\"#2f6fb3\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"7 5\"/><line x1=\"300\" y1=\"360\" x2=\"557.0\" y2=\"244.0\" stroke=\"#2f6fb3\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 4\"/><line x1=\"557.0\" y1=\"118.0\" x2=\"557.0\" y2=\"244.0\" stroke=\"#999999\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"7 5\"/><line x1=\"300\" y1=\"360\" x2=\"584.1\" y2=\"397.9\" stroke=\"#555555\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><polygon points=\"583.2,404.8 600,400 585.1,390.9\" fill=\"#555555\"/><line x1=\"300\" y1=\"360\" x2=\"402.3\" y2=\"174.0\" stroke=\"#555555\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><polygon points=\"408.4,177.4 410,160 396.2,170.6\" fill=\"#555555\"/><line x1=\"300\" y1=\"360\" x2=\"300.0\" y2=\"96.0\" stroke=\"#555555\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><polygon points=\"307.0,96.0 300,80 293.0,96.0\" fill=\"#555555\"/><line x1=\"300\" y1=\"360\" x2=\"545.4\" y2=\"129.0\" stroke=\"#c0392b\" stroke-width=\"6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><polygon points=\"550.8,134.8 557.0,118.0 539.9,123.1\" fill=\"#c0392b\"/><path d=\"M 369.4 369.3 A 70 70 0 0 0 363.8 331.2\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"382\" y=\"354\" font-size=\"22\" font-style=\"italic\" fill=\"#333333\">θ</text><path d=\"M 300.0 270.0 A 90 90 0 0 1 365.5 298.3\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"348\" y=\"250\" font-size=\"22\" font-style=\"italic\" fill=\"#333333\">φ</text><circle cx=\"300\" cy=\"360\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#333333\"/><text x=\"282\" y=\"378\" font-size=\"18\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#333333\">O</text><text x=\"612\" y=\"414\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#333333\">X</text><text x=\"398\" y=\"152\" font-size=\"18\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#333333\">Y</text><text x=\"312\" y=\"70\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#333333\">Z</text><text x=\"569.0\" y=\"112.0\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#333333\">P</text><text x=\"567.0\" y=\"264.0\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#333333\">P′</text><text x=\"450\" y=\"258\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#c0392b\">r</text></svg></p><p class=\"desc\"><b>Figura 5</b>: O mesmo vetor fora do plano. Em coordenadas lineares ele tem x = 4 m, y = 3 m e z = 5 m; em coordenadas radiais ele tem r = 5 m e θ ≈ 37°; em coordenadas esféricas ele tem r = 7,1 m, θ ≈ 37° e φ = 45°. Um quarto transparente da esfera, de raio r, é desenhado ao redor de O, para que você possa verificar as coordenadas esféricas dentro dela.</p>",
